    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Pixel Mapping Mode is intended to be used as a virtual pixel wall. This
    mode has 10 DMX channels reserved for Dimmer, Strobe and Corner Pinning. The
    channels from channel 11 and upward are RGB channels for each pixel. The amount
    of pixels can be configured by adjusting the Rows and Columns in 8 pixel increments.
    \n\nChannel Mapping:\n\nCH 1: Master Dimmer\nCH 2: Strobe\nCH 3-10: Corner Pinning
    X and Y (Calculated from the bottom left corner of the screen)\n\n"
